@motong/dsh-voice README · 安装：3. 在 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` 里加依赖并把 `"@motong/dsh-voice"` 加进 `dsh.profile.bundles`：

```json
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "@motong/dsh-voice": "^0.4.1"
     },

4. 重启 DSH，刷新页面即可。

@motong/dsh-voice README · How it works：- **Speech-to-text**: browser-native `SpeechRecognition` (Chrome/Edge).
- **Text-to-speech**: the plugin exposes `/_dsh/voice/tts` and synthesizes audio through Microsoft Edge's neural voice service (the [edge-tts](https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts) protocol). No API key required.
- Settings live in DSH's `voice` namespace (`settings.yaml`).
